# Meta family for Loon
# Set the policy on the Remote Rule subscription.
# Meta Account, Business Suite, Meta Verified and AI glasses use Meta service domains.
# Muse Code and Meta Model API endpoints under meta.ai are covered by its suffix.
# Edits uses Instagram services.

